.TH drlb_server 8 "31 Oct 2026" "2.0" "DRLB TCP Load Balancer"
.SH NAME
drlb_server, drlb_ssl_server \- DRLB TCP and SSL/TLS load balancer
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B drlb_server
.RI --config-file= file
[OPTIONS...]
.br
.B drlb_ssl_server
.RI --config-file= file
[OPTIONS...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B drlb_server
accepts TCP connections on one port and relays each one to a backend
node chosen by round robin (LB_RR), weight (LB_WEIGHTED), load percent
(LB_DISTRIB) or client address rules (LB_ASSIGNED).
.PP
When the config file has an
.B [SSLCONFIG]
section the server also terminates SSL/TLS on the frontend (TLS 1.2 and
1.3), and with
.B ssl_encrypt_backend = 1
it uses TLS to the backend nodes as well, verifying their certificates.
.PP
.B drlb_ssl_server
is a link to
.BR drlb_server .
Under that name the config file must have an [SSLCONFIG] section.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --help
Print help message and exit
.TP
.B --version
Print version number and exit
.TP
.B --check-config
Check the config file, including the TLS key and certificates, and exit
.TP
.B --debug
Enable debug mode, default level 1
.TP
.BI --debug-level= n
Set debugging level, 1-5
.TP
.B --verbose
Echo messages to the console
.TP
.BI --verbose-level= n
Set verbose level, 0-5
.TP
.BI --config-file= file
Config file to use. A default file is written if it does not exist.
.TP
.BI --log-file= file
Log to this file, overrides the config file
.TP
.BI --log-level= n
Set logging level, 0-5
.TP
.B --log-file-clear
Clear the log file when the program starts
.TP
.B --log-disable
Disable logging, overrides the config file
.TP
.BI --stats-file= file
Write server stats to this file
.TP
.B --stats-disable
Disable server stats, overrides the config file
.SH SIGNALS
.TP
.BR SIGTERM ", " SIGINT
Stop accepting connections, let open connections finish, then exit.
.TP
.B SIGUSR2
Enable debug mode or raise the debug level.
.TP
.B SIGUSR1
Lower the debug level.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/drlb/active_configs.list
Configs started by drlb_server.service
.TP
.I /etc/drlb/ssl_bridge.cfg
Config used by drlb_ssl_server.service
.TP
.I /etc/sysconfig/drlb_server, /etc/sysconfig/drlb_ssl_server
Service settings
.TP
.I /var/log/drlb
Log and stats files
.SH SEE ALSO
/usr/share/doc/drlb/README.md
